{"id":"34a6558383e94659","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph.md","title":"弱算术中的有界唯一函数图","display":"df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph — 弱算术中的有界唯一函数图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph","aliases":["72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph"],"display":"df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph — 弱算术中的有界唯一函数图","depends_on":["[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]","[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]"],"chapter":"II","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.II Theorem1.2.7.2, print88/PDF100; local signature for the bounded graph condition","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph — 弱算术中的有界唯一函数图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"fb2b2dbad774692a\" href=\"?note=fb2b2dbad774692a\" title=\"72-df-bounded-arithmetic\">72-df-bounded-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" href=\"?note=3e0a54fcdc8782f1\" title=\"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes\">72-df-bounded-induction-schemes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"II"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.II Theorem1.2.7.2, print88/PDF100; local signature for the bounded graph condition"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\Delta^0_0\">\\(\\rho\\in\\Delta^0_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 为互异变量表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y,z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\">\\(y,z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\)</span> 且 y≠z。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 为只含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec x\">\\(\\vec x\\)</span> 的项。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho[z/y]\">\\(\\rho[z/y]\\)</span> 为确定性的捕获避免代入；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\vec x\">\\(\\forall\\vec x\\)</span> 按表序量化。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BUG}_T(\\rho,\\vec x,y,b):\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\\forall\\vec x\\exists y\\le b\\\n\\bigl[\\rho\\land\\forall z(\\rho[z/y]\\to z=y)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BUG}_T(\\rho,\\vec x,y,b):\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\\forall\\vec x\\exists y\\le b\\\n\\bigl[\\rho\\land\\forall z(\\rho[z/y]\\to z=y)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>要求理论内证明全部输出中的唯一性，且存在一个旧语言项界；不能只在标准模型中画出一个函数图。此接口用于原书 IΔ₀ 的可定义函数与界项消去，不要求每个有界公式都给出这样的函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-bounded-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"fb2b2dbad774692a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-bounded-induction-schemes","status":"resolved","id":"3e0a54fcdc8782f1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-bounded-induction-schemes]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A})","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\Delta^0_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"y,z\\notin\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}(\\rho)\\subseteq\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec x)\\cup\\{y\\}","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho[z/y]","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\vec x","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BUG}_T(\\rho,\\vec x,y,b):\\Longleftrightarrow\nT\\vdash_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm A}}\\forall\\vec x\\exists y\\le b\\\n\\bigl[\\rho\\land\\forall z(\\rho[z/y]\\to z=y)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1667,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"II章新增9项：[[72-df-bounded-unique-arithmetic-graph]] · [[72-df-division-remainder-graphs]] · [[72-df-truncated-subtraction-graph]] · [[72-df-unique-function-definition-extension]] · [[72-lem-bounded-function-occurrence-elimination]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-division]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-minimization]] · [[72-thm-i-delta-zero-subtraction]] · [[72-thm-unique-function-definition-conservative]]"},{"id":"00439